sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant L as login.js
    participant CS as cart-service.js
    participant A as api.js
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant CC as CartController

    Note over U,LS: The guest filled a cart earlier. It is stored in localStorage.
    U->>L: Enter email and password, click Log In
    L->>L: Email must contain an at sign
    L->>A: apiLogin(email, password)
    A->>AC: POST /auth/login with JSON username (holding the email) and password
    alt wrong credentials
        AC-->>A: 401 error text
        A-->>L: throws ApiError
        L-->>U: red message on the form
    else correct credentials
        AC-->>A: 200 id, username, email
        A-->>L: user
        L->>LS: save currentUser
        L->>CS: mergeGuestCart(user.id)
        CS->>LS: read guestCart
        loop each guest line
            CS->>A: apiAddToCart(userId, productId, quantity)
            A->>CC: POST /carts/user/USERID/items
            alt enough stock
                CC-->>A: 200 CartDTO
            else not enough stock
                CC-->>A: 409 error text
                A-->>CS: ApiError (message is collected as a problem)
            end
        end
        CS->>LS: remove guestCart
        CS-->>L: list of problems (may be empty)
        alt there were problems
            L->>LS: save notice text
            L-->>U: go to the cart page, popup lists what could not be added
        else everything moved
            L-->>U: go to returnTo page (for example the cart) or the home page
        end
    end
